   "line": 23,
   "text": "Tern searches for a file in the order project, user, system, and loads only the first file it finds."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/01-configuration-loading-order-of-a-command-line-tool/old.md",
   "line": 23,
   "text": "That file is called the winning file."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/01-configuration-loading-order-of-a-command-line-tool/old.md",
   "line": 23,
   "text": "The other files are never opened, so none of their keys take effect, even keys the winning file does not mention."
  },
  {
