   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/01-configuration-loading-order-of-a-command-line-tool/old.md",
   "line": 31,
   "text": "The repository root is the nearest parent directory that contains a .git directory."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/01-configuration-loading-order-of-a-command-line-tool/old.md",
   "line": 31,
   "text": "When there is no repository, the search starts at the user file."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/01-configuration-loading-order-of-a-command-line-tool/old.md",
   "line": 35,
   "text": "Once the winning file is read, environment variables are applied on top of it, key by key."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/01-configuration-loading-order-of-a-command-line-tool/old.md",
   "line": 35,
   "text": "Flags are applied last and override both the file and the environment."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/01-configuration-loading-order-of-a-command-line-tool/old.md",
   "line": 35,
   "text": "A variable or flag for an unknown key is reported as an error."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/01-configuration-loading-order-of-a-command-line-tool/old.md",
   "line": 39,
   "text": "A project file must hold every setting the project needs, including personal ones such as the editor and the colour theme, because the user file is ignored once a project file exists."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/01-configuration-loading-order-of-a-command-line-tool/old.md",
   "line": 39,
   "text": "Most teams keep a shared template of personal keys and paste it into each new project file."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/01-configuration-loading-order-of-a-command-line-tool/old.md",
   "line": 39,
   "text": "Administrators who need a setting enforced everywhere cannot rely on the system file, since any user or project file wins over it."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/01-configuration-loading-order-of-a-command-line-tool/old.md",
   "line": 43,
   "text": "Keys hold strings, integers, booleans or lists."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/01-configuration-loading-order-of-a-command-line-tool/old.md",
   "line": 43,
   "text": "A list in the winning file is used as written."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/01-configuration-loading-order-of-a-command-line-tool/old.md",
   "line": 43,
   "text": "Unknown keys in the winning file produce a warning and are otherwise ignored."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/01-configuration-loading-order-of-a-command-line-tool/old.md",
   "line": 47,
   "text": "The command tern config show prints the path of the winning file followed by every resolved key and its value."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/01-configuration-loading-order-of-a-command-line-tool/old.md",
   "line": 47,
   "text": "Keys that came from an environment variable or a flag are marked with their source."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/01-configuration-loading-order-of-a-command-line-tool/old.md",
   "line": 47,
   "text": "The command tern config path prints only the path of the winning file, which scripts use to decide which file to edit."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/01-configuration-loading-order-of-a-command-line-tool/old.md",
   "line": 51,
   "text": "Plugins receive the resolved settings after flags are applied."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/01-configuration-loading-order-of-a-command-line-tool/old.md",
   "line": 51,
   "text": "A plugin reads its own section of the winning file, named after the plugin, and cannot see the other files."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/01-configuration-loading-order-of-a-command-line-tool/old.md",
   "line": 55,
   "text": "A syntax error in the winning file aborts the command with the file path and line number."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/01-configuration-loading-order-of-a-command-line-tool/old.md",
   "line": 55,
   "text": "Files that are not loaded are never parsed, so an error in them goes unnoticed until they become the winning file."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/01-configuration-loading-order-of-a-command-line-tool/old.md",
   "line": 59,
   "text": "Loading opens at most one file and finishes in well under a millisecond on a warm cache."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/01-configuration-loading-order-of-a-command-line-tool/old.md",
   "line": 59,
   "text": "The resolved settings are kept in memory for the life of the process."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/01-configuration-loading-order-of-a-command-line-tool/old.md",
   "line": 63,
   "text": "Whether tern config show should also list files that were found but not loaded."
  }
